{"file": "D:\\SpaceBook\\_cls6_jpg\\geo\\027.jpg", "lines": [{"text": "2.2 Types of Mountain in Pakistan", "conf": 0.84, "box": [[75, 120], [611, 127], [611, 162], [74, 156]]}, {"text": "Mountains located in Pakistan are primarily fold mountains, however volcanic landforms are also", "conf": 0.909, "box": [[71, 190], [1148, 198], [1147, 231], [70, 223]]}, {"text": "found insomeareasof Pakistan.", "conf": 0.885, "box": [[72, 224], [431, 229], [431, 258], [71, 253]]}, {"text": "i.Fold Mountains of Pakistan:Fold Mountains of Pakistan spread over northern and western", "conf": 0.921, "box": [[73, 272], [1148, 279], [1147, 308], [72, 301]]}, {"text": "parts.Therefore,theycanbeclassifiedas NorthernandWesternMountains.", "conf": 0.939, "box": [[73, 307], [920, 310], [920, 339], [72, 336]]}, {"text": "About 225 to 65 million years ago in place of these mountains existed a sea named as Tethys.", "conf": 0.922, "box": [[72, 350], [1148, 356], [1147, 389], [71, 383]]}, {"text": "Folding of the Tethy's sea bed began about 65 million years ago and continued up to 54 million", "conf": 0.898, "box": [[72, 385], [1150, 390], [1149, 420], [71, 415]]}, {"text": "Theirupliftingisstillevident.", "conf": 0.927, "box": [[74, 486], [403, 489], [403, 516], [73, 513]]}, {"text": "Karakoram, the Himalayas and the Hindu Kush are termed as Northern mountains of Pakistan.", "conf": 0.937, "box": [[73, 531], [1151, 536], [1150, 564], [72, 559]]}, {"text": "Thesemountainsstretchalmostinaneastwestdirection'.", "conf": 0.911, "box": [[74, 565], [721, 570], [721, 596], [73, 591]]}, {"text": "Safed Koh, Waziristan Hills, Koh-e-Sulaiman and Kirthar ranges are included in Western", "conf": 0.93, "box": [[72, 608], [1154, 612], [1153, 645], [71, 641]]}, {"text": "mountains ofPakistan.", "conf": 0.907, "box": [[74, 642], [335, 646], [335, 673], [73, 669]]}, {"text": "ViewofnorthernmountainsofPakistan", "conf": 0.927, "box": [[425, 1352], [804, 1356], [804, 1380], [425, 1376]]}, {"text": "GEOnline", "conf": 0.878, "box": [[93, 1411], [330, 1419], [329, 1459], [92, 1451]]}, {"text": "For more information about formation of landforms of Pakistan, visit the following link:", "conf": 0.918, "box": [[93, 1481], [1018, 1486], [1018, 1513], [92, 1508]]}, {"text": "https://www.ducksters.com/geography/country/pakistan.php", "conf": 0.902, "box": [[94, 1512], [780, 1517], [780, 1543], [93, 1538]]}, {"text": "Unit2:Mountains,PlateausandValleys", "conf": 0.895, "box": [[75, 1588], [425, 1590], [425, 1613], [74, 1611]]}, {"text": "23", "conf": 0.666, "box": [[597, 1590], [637, 1590], [637, 1622], [597, 1622]]}]}